  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated human resources management in public administration, Republic of Serbia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Action aims to support enforcement and monitoring of the civil service regulatory framework. It consists of two components: 1) In order to create clear link between key elements of HRM function, a methodology and a set of indicators will be established which will represent the instruments for supporting the work of analytical capacities. Develped tools will enable further improvement of the HR system. 2) Further several career management modalities will be introduced including variety of modern instruments at the institutional and individual level. These activities will enable design and development of different vertical and horizontal modality of the career development of the civil servants.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
